@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### --- PUBLIC (no auth) — what the website's forms call ---

### Contact form submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "contact",
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "phone": "+1 555 0100",
  "company": "Acme Inc.",
  "service": "Web Design & Development",
  "budget": "$15k – $40k",
  "timeline": "1–3 months",
  "referral": "Google search",
  "message": "We need a new marketing site built on Next.js before Q4.",
  "sourcePage": "/contact"
}

### Hero quick-quote submission (fewer fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "quick-quote",
  "name": "Sam Lee",
  "email": "sam@example.com",
  "service": "SEO",
  "message": "Looking for help with organic growth.",
  "sourcePage": "/"
}

### Validation failure → 400 with errorSources
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "X",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "message": "too short"
}

### --- ADMIN (auth required) ---

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@websyner.co",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Pipeline counts for the stat cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List leads
# @name leads
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@leadId = {{leads.response.body.$.data.0._id}}

### Filter by status / type
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads?status=new&type=contact
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search across name, email, company, message
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads?searchTerm=acme
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read one (also marks it read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move it along the pipeline
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "contacted"
}

### Add an internal note
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Called — sending a proposal on Thursday."
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
